| Method    | Purpose             |
| --------- | ------------------- |
| append()  | Add element         |
| insert()  | Insert element      |
| extend()  | Merge lists         |
| remove()  | Remove value        |
| pop()     | Remove by index     |
| clear()   | Delete all elements |
| sort()    | Sort list           |
| reverse() | Reverse list        |
| count()   | Count occurrences   |
| index()   | Find position       |
| copy()    | Copy list           |
